{"id":"1c9c7148ba67afbb","group":"29","path":"29/29-cor-fo-ac0.md","title":"带 BIT 的一阶逻辑刻画一阶一致 AC0","display":"cor-fo-ac0 — 带 BIT 的一阶逻辑刻画一阶一致 AC0","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-cor-fo-ac0","aliases":["29-cor-fo-ac0"],"display":"cor-fo-ac0 — 带 BIT 的一阶逻辑刻画一阶一致 AC0","depends_on":["[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Corollary 5.32, p.86, DjVu scan 101; Definition 5.17, p.80, scan 95","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-cor-fo-ac0"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-cor-fo-ac0</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-fo-ac0 — 带 BIT 的一阶逻辑刻画一阶一致 AC0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 5.32, p.86, DjVu scan 101; Definition 5.17, p.80, scan 95"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；核验范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为有限关系输入词汇；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 与 BIT 不属于输入符号。</li>\n<li>查询论域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a>；每个有序输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的标准 BIT 扩张由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" href=\"?note=b89b00b2e37a4ae5\" title=\"29-df-fo-q-fo\">29-df-fo-q-fo</a> 构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\">\\(Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]\\)</span> 使用该扩张的 FO 满足关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6b1e7a4a516bab79\" href=\"?note=6b1e7a4a516bab79\" title=\"29-df-circuit-classes\">29-df-circuit-classes</a> 的一阶一致、常深度、多项式大小、无界扇入 AND/OR/NOT 电路查询类；与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 使用同一有序输入编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]=\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q(\\mathrm{FO}[&lt;,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]=\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 5.32，印刷页 86、扫描页 101；一致性约定是 Definition 5.17，印刷页 80、扫描页 95。已核对推论及前后说明：FO 默认具有 BIT，AC0 采用一阶一致性；不把任意非一致电路类等同于 FO。这里在同一个有序输入域上比较查询表达力，BIT 由输入序的递增编号唯一确定。原条另写 DLOGTIME-uniform，但没有提供相应来源或定义接口，现恢复本书实际使用的一阶一致性约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-fo-q-fo]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"查询论域为 $\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$，见 [[29-df-ordering]]；每个有序输入 $A$ 的标准 BIT 扩张由 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]] 构造，$Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]$ 使用该扩张的 FO 满足关系。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-fo-q-fo","status":"resolved","id":"b89b00b2e37a4ae5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"查询论域为 $\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$，见 [[29-df-ordering]]；每个有序输入 $A$ 的标准 BIT 扩张由 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]] 构造，$Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]$ 使用该扩张的 FO 满足关系。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-circuit-classes","status":"resolved","id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]$ 取 [[29-df-circuit-classes]] 的一阶一致、常深度、多项式大小、无界扇入 AND/OR/NOT 电路查询类；与 $Q$ 使用同一有序输入编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"Q(\\mathrm{FO}[<,\\mathrm{BIT}])[\\tau]=\\mathrm{AC}^0[\\tau].","display":true}],"bytes":1633,"backlinks":[{"id":"8277156a4d684ae0","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"汇总表与 [[29-cor-fo-ac0]] 统一采用原书的一阶一致 AC0；不再保留缺来源接口的 DLOGTIME 下标。后三个来源中各自的证明限制继续有效，本条只是已有刻画的注册，不提供新的独立证明。显式拉回使 SO/ESO 的一般结构查询与其余有序输入比较处于同一论域。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-cor-fo-ac0]] — 标准数值结构上的 FO 与均匀 `\\mathrm{AC}^0`"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-62","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-cor-fo-ac0]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-cor-fo-ac0]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-cor-fo-ac0|29-cor-fo-ac0]]"}],"outgoing":["b89b00b2e37a4ae5","6b1e7a4a516bab79","4f651c8d1bdc9a58"]}